    "chunk_text": "Her onginne\u00f0 secgan be \u00feam Godes sanctum, \u00fee on Engla lande \u00e6rost reston. Sanctus Albanus, martir on Breotone, se reste\u00f0 neah W\u00e6tlingaceastre be \u00feare ea, \u00fee is genemnod \u00d0onne reste\u00f0 Columcylle on \u00feare stowe, \u00fee is genemnod Duncachan, neah \u00feare ea \u00fee is genemnod \u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sanctus Cuthberhtus on \u00feare stowe, \u00fee men hata\u00f0 Dunholm. \u00d0onne is sancte Oswoldes heafod cyninges mid sancte Cuthberhtus lichaman, and his swi\u00f0re earm is \u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sanctus Iohannes biscop on \u00feare stowe Beferlic, neah \u00feare ea Hul. \u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Ecgbriht and sancte Wilfer\u00f0 biscop and sancte Wihtburh on \u00feam mynstre, \u00fee is \u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Ceadda and sancte Cedde and sancte Ceatta on \u00feam mynstre, \u00fee is genemnod \u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Higebold on Lindesige on \u00feare stowe, \u00fee is genemnod Cecesege, neah \u00feare ea, \u00fee \u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte \u00c6\u00feered, se cyningc, and sancte Ostry\u00f0, sancte Oswoldes swustor cynges, on \u00feam \u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Eadburh Su\u00f0willum neah \u00feare ea Treonte. \u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Gu\u00f0lac on \u00feare stowe, \u00fee is genemnod Cruland, \u00fe\u00e6t mynster is on middan \u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte Ealhmund on Nor\u00f0wor\u00feig, neah \u00feare ea Deorwentan. \u00d0onne w\u00e6s sancte Botulf bebirged on \u00feam mynstre, \u00fee is genemnod Medeshamstede, \u00fe\u00e6t is neah \u00d0onne reste\u00f0 sancte \u00c6\u00feelbriht \u00e6t \u00feam biscopstole \ufffd",
